.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-config-sm2 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-config\-sm2 \- Show or change the CTAP SM2 configuration (3.0+; writes need 3.1)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-config\-sm2\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or change the CTAP SM2 configuration (3.0+; writes need 3.1)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ckman\-config\-sm2\-set(1)
Set the SM2 COSE curve/algorithm identifiers (3.1+; unspecified identifiers keep their current values)
.TP
ckman\-config\-sm2\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
